<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - State Street cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - State Street cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded State Street Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- State Street lost 3/8 to 86-7/8.</p>
</text>
